> Well, yes; AFAIK Magicbane only protexts from curses caused by carrying
> the Amulet.

Carrying the Amulet doesn't cause random curses; killing the Wizard or
performing the invocation ritual does, as one of the intermittent
effects thereafter. Magicbane helps against these, and any other
source of "malignant aura" type curses: monster spells, divine wrath,
bad throne effect. (Though it still has a 5% chance of failing to do
so.) However, fountain curses are _not_ this type, and can't be
prevented by any means. My practice is never to quaff from fountains.

